  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Thursday 3 December 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nThis executive home sits on one level at the end of a quiet private driveway, with elevated views out to the Wainui hills. Homes in Millwater with real wow factor and the fundamentals buyers want don’t come up often, and this one has both.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan living and dining area is the heart of the home. It flows straight out to the deck, making outdoor entertaining easy. The kitchen will win over keen cooks, with engineered stone benchtops, a generous island bench and a reticulated gas cooktop.\r\n\r\nAll four bedrooms are doubles, and two have their own ensuite. The master is its own retreat, with an ensuite, a walk-in wardrobe and a separate study, so you can work from home without giving up a bedroom. A second bedroom also has its own ensuite, which suits guests, teenagers or extended family. Central air conditioning keeps the home comfortable all year round.\r\n\r\nThere’s a double garage with internal access through the laundry, which is handy for unloading shopping and the kids’ sports gear. Visitors, the boat or the trailer all fit easily in the generous off-street parking.\r\n\r\nYou can walk to Central Millwater’s shops and excellent schools. The motorway is close by, and so are some of the region’s best beaches.\r\n\r\nA complete home for the discerning buyer. Don’t miss it.",
